2
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:05,840
I'm ready.
我準備好了。

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:06,700
You sure?
你確定嗎？

4
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:07,640
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:10,480
Okay, let me just straighten out your helmet there.
好吧，讓我把你的頭盔弄直。

6
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:11,420
Thanks, Daddy.
謝謝，爸爸。

7
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:14,280
No, no. One daddy, two mommies.
不，不。一個爸爸，兩個媽媽。

8
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,620
All right, it's all yours.
好吧，都是你的了。

9
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,180
Okay, okay. Here you go, there you go.
好吧，好吧。給你，給你。

10
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:25,160
Wow, Ben's first big kid's bike. This is so exciting.
哇，本的第一輛大型兒童腳踏車。這太令人興奮了。

11
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:27,620
Oh, yeah, I remember mine.
哦，是的，我記得我的。

12
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:32,840
It was my sixth birthday, and my dad took me to the park, and I got on it, and it bent.
那是我六歲生日，我爸爸帶我去公園，我上了它，它就彎了。

13
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:33,100
Yeah.
是的。

14
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:36,420
I never had a bike of my own.
我從來沒有擁有過自己的腳踏車。

15
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,000
What?
什麼？

16
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:38,800
Well, we didn't have a lot of money.
嗯，我們沒有很多錢。

17
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:42,400
But the girl across the street had the best bike.
但街對面的女孩擁有最好的腳踏車。

18
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:47,440
It was pink, and it had rainbow-colored tassels hanging off the handle grips,
它是粉紅色的，手柄上掛著彩虹色的流蘇，

19
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:52,580
and a bell, and this big white wicker basket with those plastic daisies stuck on.
還有一個鈴鐺，還有這個白色的大柳條籃，上面黏著塑膠雛菊。

20
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,700
That sounds like my first bike.
這聽起來像是我的第一輛腳踏車。

21
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,340
My dad gave me his old one.
我爸爸把他的舊的給了我。

22
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:02,240
Did the girl ever let you ride it?
那女孩讓你騎過嗎？

23
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:04,880
No, but she gave me the box that it came in.
不，但她給了我一個盒子。

24
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:08,060
It had a picture of the bike on the front.
正面有一張腳踏車的照片。

25
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:12,820
So I would sit on it, and my stepdad would drag me around the backyard.
所以我會坐在上面，我的繼父會拖著我在後院轉一圈。

26
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:15,600
That is so unfair.
那太不公平了。

27
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:18,480
Not really. I got to drag him around, too.
並不真地。我也得拖著他走。

28
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:29,760
So no one told you life was going to be this way
所以沒有人告訴你生活會是這樣

29
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:34,580
Your job's a joke, you're broke, your love life's the only way
你的工作就是個笑話，你破產了，你的愛情生活是唯一的出路

30
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:39,120
It's like you're always stuck in second gear
就像你總是卡在二檔

31
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:44,780
When it hasn't been your day, your week, your month, or even your year
當這不是你的一天，你的一週，你的一個月，甚至你的一年

32
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:48,520
But I'll be there for you
但我會在你身邊

33
00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:04,220
Hey, what are you guys doing?
嘿，你們在做什麼？

34
00:02:04,820 --> 00:02:06,440
Making holiday candy for the neighbors.
為鄰居製作節慶糖果。

35
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,060
I'm sorry, who?
對不起，誰？

36
00:02:09,740 --> 00:02:11,640
I'm going to hang this basket on the door,
我要把這個籃子掛在門上

37
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:14,000
and then when the neighbors walk by, they can all take a piece.
然後當鄰居走過時，他們都可以拿一塊。

38
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,820
But we don't know the neighbors.
但我們不認識鄰居。

39
00:02:18,260 --> 00:02:21,380
I do. There's a guy with a mustache,
我願意。有一個留著小鬍子的傢伙

40
00:02:22,420 --> 00:02:23,460
a smokes-a-lot lady,
一位經常抽煙的女士，

41
00:02:24,540 --> 00:02:25,720
some kids I've seen,
我見過一些孩子

42
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:29,280
and a red-haired guy who does not like to be called Rusty.
還有一個不喜歡被稱為 Rusty 的紅髮傢伙。

43
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,460
Oh, I know that guy.
哦，我認識那個人。

44
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,840
He also doesn't like it when you say,
他也不喜歡你說：

45
00:02:34,220 --> 00:02:35,720
Back off, Howdy Doody, I'm engaged.
退後，你好杜迪，我訂婚了。

46
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,560
You got hit on by Firebeard?
你被火鬍子攻擊了嗎？

47
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,880
See, this is exactly why I'm making this candy.
看，這正是我製作這種糖果的原因。

48
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,020
We can learn their names and get to know our neighbors.
我們可以瞭解他們的名字並瞭解我們的鄰居。

49
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:47,580
Wouldn't it be easier if we just moved?
如果我們搬家不是更容易嗎？

50
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:51,900
Good morning!
早安！

51
00:02:53,140 --> 00:02:54,180
Somebody's in a good mood.
有人心情很好。

52
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:56,040
Well, why shouldn't I be?
好吧，我為什麼不應該呢？

53
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,680
Steve, I have great friends.
史蒂夫，我有很多好朋友。

54
00:02:57,860 --> 00:02:59,400
I have a wonderful job.
我有一份很棒的工作。

55
00:02:59,420 --> 00:03:00,780
Where you can make out with your assistant.
在那裡你可以和你的助手親熱。

56
00:03:02,620 --> 00:03:04,040
Come on, it's not a big deal.
得了吧，這沒什麼大不了的。

57
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,260
We stayed up all night coming up with a plan
我們徹夜未眠想出一個計劃

58
00:03:06,260 --> 00:03:08,060
so that us dating will not be a problem.
這樣我們約會就不成問題了。

59
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:09,300
What's the plan?
計劃是什麼？

60
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:17,240
We...we are not...
我們……我們不是……

61
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:20,020
going to let it...
打算讓它...

62
00:03:20,020 --> 00:03:20,740
be a problem.
成為一個問題。

63
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,320
Wow, it took you all night to come up with that plan?
哇，你花了一晚才想出這個計劃？

64
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:27,820
Oh, well, you know, we did other stuff, too.
哦，好吧，你知道，我們還做了其他事情。

65
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:30,680
Did you two...
你們兩個有沒有...

66
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,840
Oh, Monica, come on.
哦，莫妮卡，來吧。

67
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:33,600
You know I don't sleep with guys on the first date.
你知道我不會在第一次約會就和男人上床。

68
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:35,480
Matt Weier, Mark Glenn, Ben Weiss...
馬特維爾、馬克格倫、班韋斯…

69
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,200
Anymore!
不再了！

70
00:03:43,340 --> 00:03:43,700
Hi.
你好。

71
00:03:44,060 --> 00:03:46,760
Tag, I have a conference call today, is that correct?
標籤，我今天有一個電話會議，對嗎？

72
00:03:46,940 --> 00:03:47,620
Yes, at four.
是的，四點。

73
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,260
Okay, thank you. That'll be all.
好的，謝謝。僅此而已。

74
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:51,480
Wait, wait.
等等，等等。

75
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:57,160
Did you see that?
你看到了嗎？

76
00:03:57,580 --> 00:04:00,280
That male guy had no idea there was something going on between us.
那個男人不知道我們之間發生了什麼事。

77
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,500
I better get back to my desk.
我最好回到我的辦公桌前。

78
00:04:09,820 --> 00:04:11,400
Okay, hard worker.
好吧，辛苦了。

79
00:04:13,660 --> 00:04:15,800
I'll remember to put that in your evaluation.
我會記得將其納入您的評估中。

80
00:04:16,460 --> 00:04:16,920
My what?
我的什麼？

81
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,900
Well, you've been here for two months now
嗯，你來這裡已經兩個月了

82
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:22,320
and your boss is required to hand in a performance evaluation.
而你的老闆需要提交一份績效評估。

83
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:26,900
But you know, there is one thing that I have yet to evaluate.
但你知道，有一件事我還沒評估。

84
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:34,680
Are you serious?
你是認真的？

85
00:04:35,300 --> 00:04:37,180
No, I've just always wanted to do that.
不，我只是一直想這麼做。

86
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,420
Can you help me clean this up?
你能幫我清理一下嗎？

87
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:47,340
I'm so excited to see if anyone ate my candy.
我很高興看到是否有人吃了我的糖果。

88
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:47,840
Me, too.
我也是。

89
00:04:48,220 --> 00:04:49,340
You don't have to do that.
你不必這樣做。

90
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:49,680
Thanks.
謝謝。

91
00:04:51,540 --> 00:04:53,080
The basket is totally empty.
籃子完全是空的。

92
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:54,700
My God, the neighbors ate all the candy.
天啊，鄰居們把糖果都吃光了。

93
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:55,840
Well, either that or...
好吧，要嘛那樣，要嘛...

94
00:04:56,660 --> 00:04:57,020
No.
不。

95
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,060
Not even Joey could eat that much.
就連喬伊也吃不了那麼多。

96
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,180
Little refresher.
稍微複習一下。

97
00:05:01,860 --> 00:05:02,880
Popcorn shrimp night.
爆米花蝦之夜。

98
00:05:04,380 --> 00:05:04,740
Joey!
喬伊！

99
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,720
Did you eat all the neighbor candy?
你把鄰居的糖果都吃了嗎？

100
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,020
Well, yeah, that was the plan.
嗯，是的，這就是計劃。

101
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:14,400
But by the time I got to it, there was only a couple pieces left.
但當我到達時，只剩下幾塊了。

102
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:17,440
Yeah, they've been coming by all day. They love it.
是的，他們一整天都來了。他們喜歡它。

103
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,540
They love my candy?
他們喜歡我的糖果嗎？

104
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:22,360
Oh, man, I gotta go make more.
哦，夥計，我得去賺更多。

105
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:23,400
Hey, Mark.
嘿，馬克。

106
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:25,740
You might want to make some more lasagna, too,
你可能還想做一些烤寬麵條

107
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,880
because something might have happened to a huge chunk of it.
因為其中很大一部分可能發生了什麼事。

108
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:31,780
Ross, the neighbors ate all my candy.
羅斯，鄰居們吃了我的糖果。

109
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:33,500
Mine stole my newspaper.
我的報紙偷了。

110
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,460
It's like a crime wave.
這就像犯罪浪潮。

111
00:05:39,660 --> 00:05:40,440
Pheebs, you, uh...
菲比斯，你，呃…

112
00:05:41,140 --> 00:05:41,820
You got a second?
你還有時間嗎？

113
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:42,360
Sure.
當然。

114
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,320
Yeah.
是的。

115
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:45,220
Ever since you, uh...
自從你，呃...

116
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:47,140
told me that story about that bike,
告訴我關於那輛腳踏車的故事，

117
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,080
I couldn't stop thinking about it.
我無法停止思考它。

118
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:51,660
I mean, everyone should have a first bike, you know?
我的意思是，每個人都應該擁有第一輛腳踏車，你知道嗎？

119
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:54,560
So...
所以...

120
00:05:55,260 --> 00:05:55,780
Oh!
哦！

121
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:58,680
Oh, my God, Ross!
哦，天哪，羅斯！

122
00:05:59,580 --> 00:06:00,520
You like it?
你喜歡嗎？

123
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,960
I love it!
我喜歡它！

124
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:02,240
Yeah?
是的？

125
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:03,060
Oh!
哦！

126
00:06:03,620 --> 00:06:03,980
Oh!
哦！

127
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,600
And I love you!
我愛你！

128
00:06:06,580 --> 00:06:07,620
Not that way.
不是那樣的。

129
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,400
But the bike got you a lot closer.
但腳踏車讓你離我們更近了。

130
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:10,760
Oh.
哦。

131
00:06:11,620 --> 00:06:13,980
Well, uh, take it downstairs, you know?
嗯，呃，把它帶到樓下，你知道嗎？

132
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,920
Give it a test drive.
試駕一下。

133
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:16,380
Okay.
好的。

134
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:18,060
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

135
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:19,580
My first bike!
我的第一輛腳踏車！

136
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:23,480
Thank you for the best present I've ever gotten.
謝謝你給我的最好的禮物。

137
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:24,900
You're welcome.
不客氣。

138
00:06:27,820 --> 00:06:29,580
Oh, and Chandler's about to cry.
哦，錢德勒快要哭了。

139
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,360
I'm not.
我不是。

140
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:35,840
Hey, dude, it's okay.
嘿，夥計，沒關係。

141
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:36,760
I kind of, uh...
我有點，呃...

142
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,220
got to meet a little too.
也得見面一點。

143
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:42,920
Yeah, I'm just so glad I could make her happy.
是的，我很高興能讓她開心。

144
00:06:43,660 --> 00:06:44,020
Thanks.
謝謝。

145
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,660
I'm glad I'm not alone on this.
我很高興我並不孤單。

146
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,300
Yeah, you are.
是的，你是。

147
00:06:46,340 --> 00:06:46,680
Yeah, you are.
是的，你是。

148
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:53,260
Who is that?
那是誰？

149
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:54,580
Don't worry.
不用擔心。

150
00:06:54,660 --> 00:06:55,080
I'm brave.
我很勇敢。

151
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:55,980
I am brave.
我很勇敢。

152
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,260
I am brave.
我很勇敢。

153
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:00,720
No, no, no, no, no.
不，不，不，不，不。

154
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:04,160
Can you tell me who is there, please?
你能告訴我誰在那裡嗎？

155
00:07:05,980 --> 00:07:06,960
My name's Gary.
我叫加里。

156
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:07,800
I live upstairs.
我住在樓上。

157
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:11,520
Hi.
你好。

158
00:07:11,700 --> 00:07:12,040
Hi.
你好。

159
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:13,980
Do you know what time it is?
你知道現在幾點了嗎？

160
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:14,980
It's candy time.
吃糖果的時間到了。

161
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:19,680
My roommate says that they taste like little drops of heaven.
我的室友說它們嘗起來就像天堂的小滴。

162
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,740
Oh, please.
哦，拜託。

163
00:07:22,060 --> 00:07:23,040
Did you hear that?
你聽到了嗎？

164
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:24,300
Little drops of heaven.
天堂的小水滴。

165
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:27,520
4 a.m.
凌晨 4 點

166
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,020
So, can I get some candy?
那麼，我可以買點糖果嗎？

167
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:34,560
I am sorry, but some of us have to get up early and go to work.
抱歉，我們中的一些人必須早起去上班。

168
00:07:35,700 --> 00:07:37,960
He does not know that I am not some of us.
他不知道我不是我們中的一些人。

169
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:40,740
He can hear me, can't he?
他聽得到我的聲音，不是嗎？

170
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,940
I'm sorry, but I'll put some out first thing in the morning.
抱歉，但我早上第一件事就是把一些東西拿出來。

171
00:07:46,180 --> 00:07:46,820
Well, okay.
好吧，好吧。

172
00:07:46,980 --> 00:07:47,820
I'll swing by later.
我稍後會過去。

173
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:49,780
You live in this building?
你住在這棟大樓裡嗎？

174
00:07:51,660 --> 00:07:53,700
Seems like I would have remembered you.
看來我會記得你的。

175
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:57,720
Nightgare.
宵夜。

176
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:04,920
Is there anybody in this building that does not hit on you?
這棟大樓裡有沒有人不喜歡你的？

177
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,260
Smokes a lot, lady.
抽煙很多，女士。

178
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:08,960
Oh, wait.
哦，等等。

179
00:08:09,060 --> 00:08:09,980
That is not true.
那不是真的。

180
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,960
So, did you read your evaluation yet?
那麼，你有讀過你的評價了嗎？

181
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,920
No, it was marked confidential.
不，它被標記為機密。

182
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:29,160
I just sent it down to human resources.
我剛剛將其傳送給人力資源部。

183
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:33,460
Okay, please.
好的，請。

184
00:08:33,560 --> 00:08:34,240
You're kidding, right?
你在開玩笑吧？

185
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,640
I wrote that one as a joke for you.
我寫那篇文章是為了給你開玩笑。

186
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,660
A joke they would appreciate?
他們會欣賞的笑話嗎？

187
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,460
I'm thinking no.
我想不。

188
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:42,700
What did you say?
你說什麼？

189
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:46,100
I said that I thought you were a good kisser.
我說我認為你接吻技術很好。

190
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:50,180
And that I liked your teeny tiny tushy.
我還說我喜歡你那小小的毛茸茸的東西。

191
00:08:51,860 --> 00:08:53,600
No, not my tushy.
不，不是我的屁股。

192
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,100
Oh, it gets worse.
哦，情況變得更糟了。

193
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:58,140
When asked if you take initiative, I wrote yes.
當被問到你是否主動時，我回答是。

194
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:00,980
He was able to unhook my bra with minimal supervision.
他在最少的監督下就解開了我的胸罩。

195
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:06,420
And under problems with performance, I wrote, dear God, I hope not.
在效能問題下，我寫道，親愛的上帝，我希望不會。

196
00:09:07,420 --> 00:09:11,580
And then I drew a little smiley face.
然後我畫了一個小笑臉。

197
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:14,720
And then a small pornographic sketch.
然後是一個色情小草圖。

198
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:27,160
Oh, that is so sweet of you to give Phoebe that bike.
哦，你把那輛腳踏車送給菲比真是太好了。

199
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:29,380
When I heard the story, I almost cried.
當我聽到這個故事時，我幾乎哭了。

200
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,220
Almost cried, huh?
差點就哭了吧？

201
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,620
Hear that, Chandler? Almost cried.
聽到了嗎，錢德勒？差點哭了。

202
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:38,740
Hey, you cry every time somebody talks about Titanic.
嘿，每次有人談論泰坦尼克號你都會哭。

203
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,620
Those two had only each other.
那兩個人只有彼此。

204
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,200
Phoebe really likes the bike.
菲比真的很喜歡這輛腳踏車。

205
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:47,000
Oh, yeah. I saw her walking it down the street the other day.
哦，是的。前幾天我看見她在街上散步。

206
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:49,980
She had these flowers in the basket. It was so cute.
她把這些花放在籃子裡。真是太可愛了。

207
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:52,520
Yeah, I saw her this morning walking it by the park.
是的，我今天早上看到她在公園散步。

208
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:55,980
Wait a minute, she was walking the bike?
等一下，她是在騎腳踏車嗎？

209
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,180
Both times?
兩次？

210
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,120
Hey, Pheebs.
嘿，菲比斯。

211
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,380
Oh, hi.
哦，嗨。

212
00:10:01,780 --> 00:10:03,320
Hey, so are you enjoying the bike?
嘿，你喜歡騎腳踏車嗎？

213
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:05,080
Oh, uh-huh, so much.
哦哦，就這麼多了。

214
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:10,980
Pheebs, you, uh, you do know how to ride a bike, don't you?
菲比，你，呃，你確實知道如何騎腳踏車，不是嗎？

215
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:13,960
Of course.
當然。

216
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,680
Can we see you ride it?
我們可以看到你騎它嗎？

217
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:18,800
Okay.
好的。

218
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:34,720
See?
看？

219
00:10:41,780 --> 00:10:44,560
See, this is why I told you never get involved with your assistants.
看，這就是為什麼我告訴你永遠不要與你的助手有任何瓜葛。

220
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:47,700
And there's no such thing as keeping secrets when it comes to having affairs.
當涉及外遇時，沒有什麼可以保守秘密的。

221
00:10:49,140 --> 00:10:50,440
Did you hear that, Chandler?
你聽到了嗎，錢德勒？

222
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,340
No such thing.
沒有這樣的事。

223
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:57,000
What happened? I'm just eating candy.
發生了什麼事？我只是在吃糖果。

224
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,220
Maybe it's not as bad as I think.
也許事情並沒有我想像的那麼糟。

225
00:11:01,220 --> 00:11:03,240
You know, maybe they didn't take it the way I meant it.
你知道，也許他們並沒有照我的意思來理解。

226
00:11:03,660 --> 00:11:04,060
Absolutely.
絕對地。

227
00:11:04,740 --> 00:11:09,080
You know, because tushy can mean both ass and good worker.
你知道，因為 tuthy 既可以指混蛋，也可以指好工人。

228
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,840
Oh, I just gotta get the thing back.
哦，我得把東西拿回來。

229
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:13,560
Hey, Rach?
嘿，瑞秋？

230
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,060
Yeah?
是的？

231
00:11:14,180 --> 00:11:17,060
That sketch you mentioned, why did it look a little something like this?
你提到的那個草圖，為什麼看起來有點像這樣？

232
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:20,080
Oh, my God, Joey!
哦，天哪，喬伊！

233
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:23,360
What is the matter with you?
你怎麼了？

234
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:29,040
Well, I'll tell you, this little talent came in handy before I could afford porn.
好吧，我告訴你，在我買得起色情片之前，這個小天賦就派上用場了。

235
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:38,680
Hi, I'm sorry. I know it's after hours, but I really need candy.
嗨，對不起。我知道已經下班了，但我真的需要糖果。

236
00:11:40,020 --> 00:11:42,900
I'm sorry, I can't help you. See? Rules are rules.
抱歉，我幫不了你。看？規則就是規則。

237
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:47,760
Please, I have people coming from out of town today, and I told them all about your candy.
拜託，今天有人從外地來，我把你的糖果的事告訴了他們。

238
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,020
I'm kidding.
我在開玩笑。

239
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:50,560
Out-of-towners, huh?
外地人吧？

240
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:52,440
What did you tell them?
你告訴他們什麼了？

241
00:11:52,740 --> 00:11:56,260
I told them your candy was absolutely indescribable.
我告訴他們你的糖果絕對是難以形容的。

242
00:11:56,680 --> 00:12:00,460
Well, some people have been saying it's, you know, little drops of heaven, but whatever.
好吧，有些人一直說這是，你知道，天堂的小滴，但無論如何。

243
00:12:01,900 --> 00:12:03,100
Please, can't you help me out?
拜託，你不能幫我一下嗎？

244
00:12:03,580 --> 00:12:05,680
Hey, Janet, do we know that lady?
嘿，珍妮特，我們認識那位女士嗎？

245
00:12:06,340 --> 00:12:10,300
Maybe. Isn't she the woman who lives below you and has sex really loud?
或許。她不是住在你樓下做愛聲音很大的那個女人嗎？

246
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:14,620
Oh, right. I'll do it just this once, but you can't tell anybody.
哦，對了。我只會做這一次，但你不能告訴任何人。

247
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,400
Yes, yes. Please, just give it to me.
是的，是的。請把它給我吧。

248
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,740
Yeah, that's her.
是的，就是她。

249
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:19,900
Thank you.
謝謝。

250
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:23,800
It's unbelievable. I can't believe that sign didn't work.
真是難以置信。我不敢相信那個標誌不起作用。

251
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:26,700
You know what would work? Stop making candy.
你知道什麼會起作用嗎？別再再做糖果了

252
00:12:28,060 --> 00:12:29,300
But they like it.
但他們喜歡它。

253
00:12:30,460 --> 00:12:31,680
You mean they like you.
你的意思是他們喜歡你。

254
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:33,760
Maybe.
或許。

255
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:37,660
Is that why you became a chef? So that people would like you?
這就是你成為廚師的原因嗎？這樣人們就會喜歡你？

256
00:12:38,220 --> 00:12:41,480
You really want to talk about getting people to like you, huh, funny man?
你真的很想談論如何讓人們喜歡你，嗯，有趣的人？

257
00:12:51,700 --> 00:12:55,020
Okay, now just remember everything I taught you, and you'll be fine.
好吧，現在只要記得我教你的一切，你就會沒事的。

258
00:12:55,340 --> 00:12:56,380
Okay? Here we go.
好的？開始了。

259
00:12:58,160 --> 00:12:59,120
Ready? Set?
準備好？放？

260
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:02,060
Wait, this seat is really uncomfortable.
等等，這個座位真是不舒服。

261
00:13:02,780 --> 00:13:05,200
Maybe before we start, we should just get another one.
也許在我們開始之前，我們應該再買一份。

262
00:13:05,580 --> 00:13:08,500
Perhaps like an airplane seat or a beanbag chair.
也許像飛機座椅或豆袋椅。

263
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:14,080
Baby, you can't get out of this, okay? You have to learn how to ride a bike.
寶貝，你無法擺脫這一切，好嗎？你必須學習如何騎腳踏車。

264
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:16,520
Why? Why do I have to learn?
為什麼？為什麼我必須學習？

265
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:20,620
Well, in case of an emergency.
嗯，以防萬一發生緊急情況。

266
00:13:21,420 --> 00:13:22,740
What kind of emergency?
什麼樣的緊急狀況？

267
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:27,760
Well, what if a man comes along and puts a gun to your head and says,
好吧，如果一個男人過來用槍指著你的頭說：

268
00:13:28,020 --> 00:13:32,320
You ride this bike, or I'll shoot you.
你騎這輛腳踏車，否則我就開槍打死你。

269
00:13:33,680 --> 00:13:36,140
Okay, I would ring the bell to distract him,
好吧，我會按鈴分散他的注意力，

270
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:39,020
and then I would knock the gun out of his hand with a Chinese throwing star.
然後我會用中國飛鏢將他手中的槍打掉。

271
00:13:40,940 --> 00:13:47,520
Okay, baby, just get on the bike, and hey, I'll hold you up and push you.
好吧，寶貝，騎上腳踏車吧，嘿，我會抱住你並推你。

272
00:13:47,780 --> 00:13:48,100
Okay?
好的？

273
00:13:49,380 --> 00:13:50,620
You won't let go?
你不會放手嗎？

274
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:51,600
No.
不。

275
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,480
You swear?
你發誓嗎？

276
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:53,660
I swear.
我發誓。

277
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,240
Okay.
好的。

278
00:13:56,540 --> 00:13:57,000
Come on.
快點。

279
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:01,420
Alright, here we go.
好吧，讓我們開始吧。

280
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:02,340
Alright?
好吧？

281
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:02,800
Alright.
好吧。

282
00:14:03,540 --> 00:14:04,140
Feel good?
感覺好嗎？

283
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:05,680
Alright, try pedaling.
好吧，嘗試踩踏。

284
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,160
That's it, you're doing great.
就是這樣，你做得很好。

285
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:09,080
You're doing great. Yes, yes, yes, take control.
你做得很好。是啊是啊，控制住。

286
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:09,720
Yes?
是的？

287
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:10,360
Whee!
哎喲！

288
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,000
Yes!
是的！

289
00:14:12,420 --> 00:14:14,820
Oh, oh, oh, no!
哦，哦，哦，不！

290
00:14:17,660 --> 00:14:18,700
You swore!
你發誓！

291
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,520
I just thought you were doing so well.
我只是覺得你做得很好。

292
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:20,820
Alright!
好吧！

293
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:21,800
Shot!
射擊！

294
00:14:22,180 --> 00:14:22,700
Shot!
射擊！

295
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:30,260
It's a legitimate learning technique.
這是一種合法的學習技巧。

296
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:32,400
Wow.
哇。

297
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:46,180
Hey, there's some people outside asking about candy.
嘿，外面有人問糖果。

298
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:47,700
Well, they're just going to have to wait, aren't they?
好吧，他們只需要等待，不是嗎？

299
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:48,940
I only got two hands!
我只有兩隻手！

300
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:51,000
Do you need some help?
您需要協助嗎？

301
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:51,660
No!
不！

302
00:14:51,940 --> 00:14:52,960
You don't know the system!
你不瞭解系統！

303
00:14:53,660 --> 00:14:55,120
You don't need nobody messing with the system!
您不需要任何人擾亂系統！

304
00:14:56,820 --> 00:15:01,020
By the way, the week before your wedding, you may not see a lot of me.
順便說一句，在你婚禮前一週，你可能不會經常見到我。

305
00:15:11,380 --> 00:15:12,440
Oh, hell, a liar.
噢，該死，一個騙子。

306
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:19,560
Look, I'm really sorry I let go of the bike.
聽著，我真的很抱歉我放棄了腳踏車。

307
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:21,500
I could have been killed, I hope you know.
我可能會被殺，我希望你知道。

308
00:15:23,820 --> 00:15:25,520
I know, I know.
我知道，我知道。

309
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:30,220
But can we please try it again, huh?
但我們可以再試一次嗎？

310
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:32,000
I mean, you were so close, Phoebe.
我的意思是，你是如此親密，菲比。

311
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:33,520
Well, I would love to.
嗯，我很樂意。

312
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:38,520
But the bike got stolen and the police have no suspects.
但腳踏車被偷了，警方沒有發現任何嫌疑犯。

313
00:15:45,420 --> 00:15:45,900
Phoebe.
菲比。

314
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:46,700
What?
什麼？

315
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:50,840
What the hell?
我勒個去？

316
00:15:53,100 --> 00:15:54,140
Alright, you know what?
好吧，你知道嗎？

317
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:57,500
If you are not going to learn how to ride this bike, then I'm sorry.
如果您不打算學習如何騎這輛腳踏車，那麼我很抱歉。

318
00:15:57,680 --> 00:15:59,160
I'm just going to have to take it back.
我只得把它拿回來。

319
00:15:59,300 --> 00:16:00,160
What? Why?
什麼？為什麼？

320
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:00,880
Because.
因為。

321
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:01,880
Because.
因為。

322
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:02,980
It's...
這是...

323
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:09,340
It'd be like you having this guitar and never playing it.
這就好像你擁有這把吉他卻從未彈奏過一樣。

324
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:12,620
Okay, this guitar wants to be played.
好的，這把吉他想要彈奏。

325
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:16,400
And this bike wants to be ridden.
這輛腳踏車想要被騎乘。

326
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:22,520
And if you don't ride it, you're killing its spirit.
如果你不駕馭它，你就是在扼殺牠的精神。

327
00:16:24,260 --> 00:16:28,100
The bike is dying.
腳踏車快要死了。

328
00:16:32,700 --> 00:16:36,520
Alright, if you care enough to make up that load of crap, okay.
好吧，如果你夠在意，能編出那麼多廢話，好吧。

329
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:38,520
Great, great.
太棒了，太棒了。

330
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:44,020
You're making the bike very happy.
你讓腳踏車非常高興。

331
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:45,180
Okay, Ross.
好吧，羅斯。

332
00:16:48,300 --> 00:16:49,420
Please don't die.
請不要死。

333
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:58,460
You're going to have to get into Mr. Zellner's office.
你必須進入澤爾納先生的辦公室。

334
00:16:58,780 --> 00:17:01,080
Now, he doesn't get in until ten, so he's no problem.
現在，他要到十點才能進去，所以他沒有問題。

335
00:17:01,340 --> 00:17:05,100
But his assistant, Betty, she comes in early to eat her breakfast at her desk.
但他的助手貝蒂很早就來了，在辦公桌前吃早餐。

336
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:06,280
That's kind of sad.
這有點悲傷。

337
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:07,780
Yeah, well, Betty's kind of sad.
是的，貝蒂有點難過。

338
00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:12,600
Which is why I believe I can lure her away with these chocolates.
這就是為什麼我相信我可以用這些巧克力引誘她離開。

339
00:17:14,100 --> 00:17:16,580
Now, while I distract her, you go in the office.
現在，我要分散她的注意力，你就去辦公室吧。

340
00:17:16,700 --> 00:17:17,080
Got it.
知道了。

341
00:17:17,180 --> 00:17:17,680
Let's roll.
讓我們滾吧。

342
00:17:19,740 --> 00:17:20,540
Hello, Rachel.
你好，雷切爾。

343
00:17:20,760 --> 00:17:21,880
You got a minute?
你有時間嗎？

344
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:23,220
Yeah, sure.
是的，當然。

345
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:24,780
Mr. Zellner, for you, anything.
澤爾納先生，為了你，什麼都可以。

346
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:25,100
A minute.
一分鐘。

347
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,120
Okay, great.
好的，太好了。

348
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,480
Abort the plan, abort the plan.
放棄計劃，放棄計劃。

349
00:17:30,220 --> 00:17:32,200
Actually, I'd like to speak to both of you.
事實上，我想和你們兩個談談。

350
00:17:33,420 --> 00:17:33,780
Okay.
好的。

351
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:38,100
Well, can we get you anything, Mr. Zellner?
那麼，澤爾納先生，我們能為您提供什麼嗎？

352
00:17:38,260 --> 00:17:39,620
Maybe some chocolates?
也許一些巧克力？

353
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:44,380
No, thanks, but I'll give these to Betty.
不，謝謝，但我會把這些給貝蒂。

354
00:17:46,340 --> 00:17:48,260
So, I read your evaluation of Tag.
所以，我讀了你對Tag的評價。

355
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:52,640
Or, to use his full name, Tag Sweetcheeks Jones.
或者，用他的全名，Tag Sweetcheeks Jones。

356
00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:55,640
Something going on with you two?
你們兩個有什麼事嗎？

357
00:17:57,600 --> 00:17:59,220
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

358
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:02,640
Can you imagine if there was?
你能想像如果有的話嗎？

359
00:18:03,760 --> 00:18:06,760
I mean, what would happen exactly?
我的意思是，到底會發生什麼事？

360
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:11,440
Well, I'd be forced to file a report.
好吧，我將被迫提交報告。

361
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:13,660
I'd have to consult with the legal department.
我必須諮詢法律部門。

362
00:18:14,500 --> 00:18:16,780
And your future at the company would be in jeopardy.
你在公司的未來將處於危險之中。

363
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:19,860
Well, I...
嗯，我...

364
00:18:19,860 --> 00:18:23,040
Mr. Zellner, I'm the one who filled in that evaluation.
Zellner 先生，我是填寫該評估的人。

365
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:23,920
Oh, no, no, no.
哦，不，不，不。

366
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,180
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
是啊，是啊，是啊，是啊，是啊。

367
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,220
I thought it would be funny.
我覺得這會很有趣。

368
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:31,120
You wrote that you have a cute tushy.
你寫道你有一個可愛的毛茸茸的。

369
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:33,500
Yes.
是的。

370
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:35,900
I have a weird sense of humor.
我有一種奇怪的幽默感。

371
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:39,080
And I'm kind of strangely proud of my butt.
奇怪的是，我對自己的屁股感到驕傲。

372
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:42,280
It's kind of a risky joke, Tag.
這是一個危險的玩笑，塔格。

373
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:44,880
And what is this drawing?
還有這幅畫是什麼？

374
00:18:44,940 --> 00:18:46,240
I can't figure out what this is.
我不明白這是什麼。

375
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,620
You're looking at it upside down.
你正在顛倒地看著它。

376
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:48,880
You know what? It doesn't matter.
你知道嗎？沒關係。

377
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:53,160
Hey, it's not like I don't have a sense of humor, huh?
嘿嘿，我不是沒有幽默感吧？

378
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:56,840
Hell, I even enjoy a naughty limerick every now and then.
天哪，我甚至時不時地喜歡一首調皮的打油詩。

379
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:01,820
But there's a time and a place, huh?
但有時間和地點，對吧？

380
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:06,120
Unless you have a limerick right now.
除非你現在有一首打油詩。

381
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:09,420
No?
不？

382
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:10,200
Okay.
好的。

383
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:12,920
Well, you've got my fax number.
嗯，你有我的傳真號碼。

384
00:19:20,560 --> 00:19:22,160
I can't believe you did that.
我不敢相信你竟然這麼做了。

385
00:19:22,360 --> 00:19:23,320
That was really sweet.
那真是太甜蜜了。

386
00:19:23,860 --> 00:19:25,000
Ah, don't worry about it.
啊，別擔心。

387
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:26,700
No, you could have lost your job.
不，你可能會失業。

388
00:19:26,980 --> 00:19:27,720
Are you kidding me?
你在開玩笑吧？

389
00:19:27,860 --> 00:19:29,900
With a cute butt like this, I'd find work.
有了這麼可愛的屁股，我就能找到工作了。

390
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:33,440
Thank you, you're great.
謝謝你，你很棒。

391
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:37,020
You know what?
你知道嗎？

392
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:37,520
What?
什麼？

393
00:19:38,580 --> 00:19:39,620
I feel great.
我感覺很棒。

394
00:19:43,860 --> 00:19:44,740
In fact...
事實上...

395
00:19:47,540 --> 00:19:48,140
What?
什麼？

396
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:53,040
It just, it took me so long to get that desk organized.
只是，我花了很長時間才整理好那張桌子。

397
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:54,220
I'm sorry.
對不起。

398
00:19:56,180 --> 00:19:57,420
There it is.
就在那裡。

399
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:11,300
What is going on?
到底是怎麼回事？

400
00:20:11,840 --> 00:20:12,980
We're waiting for the candy.
我們在等糖果。

401
00:20:13,620 --> 00:20:14,720
Bring out the candy!
把糖果拿出來！

402
00:20:14,740 --> 00:20:16,820
Yeah, ladies, give us candy!
是啊，女士們，給我們糖果吧！

403
00:20:19,220 --> 00:20:19,700
Joey?
喬伊？

404
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:22,100
What's up, buddy?
怎麼了，哥們？

405
00:20:22,340 --> 00:20:23,020
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

406
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:25,820
Waiting for candy.
等待糖果。

407
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:28,240
Get in here.
進來吧。

408
00:20:29,360 --> 00:20:31,840
Hey, and you cannot smoke in here.
嘿，你不能在這裡抽煙。

409
00:20:36,220 --> 00:20:37,180
Merry Christmas.
聖誕快樂。

410
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:40,440
Okay, guys, the candy is coming.
好了，小夥伴們，糖果來了。

411
00:20:40,540 --> 00:20:42,740
I just need another 15 minutes for the chocolate to cool.
我只需要再等 15 分鐘讓巧克力冷卻。

412
00:20:44,740 --> 00:20:46,640
All right, everybody, just be quiet, be quiet, be quiet.
好吧，大家安靜，安靜，安靜。

413
00:20:46,860 --> 00:20:48,320
Pipe, pipe, pipe, pipe down.
管子，管子，管子，管子下來。

414
00:20:49,320 --> 00:20:50,940
What is the matter with you people?
你們怎麼了？

415
00:20:51,580 --> 00:20:55,380
This woman was trying to do a nice thing for you, and look at her.
這個女人想為你做一件好事，看看她。

416
00:20:57,900 --> 00:20:59,240
She is a mess.
她一團糟。

417
00:21:00,380 --> 00:21:03,540
Her hair's not brushed, she's got dark circles under her eyes,
她的頭髮沒有梳過，她的眼睛下面有黑眼圈，

418
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:07,100
chocolate on her face, and she is still stunning.
臉上沾滿了巧克力，依然美艷動人。

419
00:21:10,500 --> 00:21:14,320
She was making candy so she could try to get to know all of you,
她正在製作糖果，這樣她就可以嘗試瞭解你們所有人，

420
00:21:14,320 --> 00:21:17,540
and I'll bet that not one of you can tell me her name.
我敢打賭你們中沒有人能告訴我她的名字。

421
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:18,620
Am I right?
我說得對嗎？

422
00:21:20,380 --> 00:21:21,180
Candy Lady?
糖果小姐？

423
00:21:23,420 --> 00:21:24,740
No, not Candy Lady.
不，不是糖果小姐。

424
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,900
Hey, we know it. Can we have candy?
嘿，我們知道。我們可以吃糖果嗎？

425
00:21:29,940 --> 00:21:30,920
All right, we know it.
好吧，我們知道了。

426
00:21:32,500 --> 00:21:34,000
Forget it. All of you, forget it.
忘了它。你們都忘了吧。

427
00:21:34,040 --> 00:21:36,360
You've ruined it. Go home. You've ruined it. You've ruined it.
你毀了它。回家吧。你毀了它。你毀了它。

428
00:21:36,780 --> 00:21:39,780
That's what I ruined. You guys ruined everything. You ruined it.
這就是我毀掉的。你們毀了一切。你毀了它。

429
00:21:47,260 --> 00:21:48,240
Thank you.
謝謝。

430
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:49,200
You're welcome.
不客氣。

431
00:21:51,260 --> 00:21:52,960
Did you smoke?
你抽煙嗎？

432
00:21:53,900 --> 00:21:56,320
No. Smokes a lot, lady.
不，抽煙很多，女士。

433
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:58,800
Blew smoke directly into my mouth.
直接把煙吹進嘴裡。

434
00:22:00,060 --> 00:22:01,440
Are you okay?
你還好嗎？

435
00:22:01,900 --> 00:22:04,420
I'm fine now, but it was really scary there for a while.
我現在很好，但有一段時間我真的很害怕。

436
00:22:04,860 --> 00:22:07,320
Someone slipped a threatening note under the door.
有人在門下塞了一張威脅字條。

437
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:09,220
Oh, yeah. Sorry about that.
哦，是的。對此感到抱歉。

438
00:22:09,560 --> 00:22:10,780
Mob mentality or whatever.
暴民心態或其他什麼。

439
00:22:21,500 --> 00:22:24,440
I can't believe it. I did it. I rode a bike.
我簡直不敢相信。我做到了。我騎腳踏車。

440
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:27,200
I never thought I'd be able to do that.
我從沒想過我能做到這一點。

441
00:22:27,340 --> 00:22:28,200
Thank you, Ross.
謝謝你，羅斯。

442
00:22:28,340 --> 00:22:30,540
Oh, hey, don't thank me. Thank yourself.
哦，嘿，別謝我。謝謝你自己。

443
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:34,140
You're the one who faced your fears and ultimately overcame them.
你是那個直面恐懼並最終克服恐懼的人。

444
00:22:35,020 --> 00:22:37,880
Don't be so corny, Ross. It's not an after-school special.
別這麼老土，羅斯。這不是課後特別節目。

445
00:22:52,780 --> 00:22:53,400
You
你

